This add-on is an original bridge. It vendors nothing, but depends on and
attributions are owed to:

  * ResonantOS browser-first (2.0.0-alpha) delegation pattern — the host
    routes this bridge calls (/addons/delegate,
    /opencode/delegation/{start,status,artifact,cancel}), the governed
    delegation packet and its human-approval boundary, and the
    capability-token scheme (RESONANTOS_BROWSER_FIRST_* env names) this
    bridge reuses but never re-mints. Copyright their respective holders.

  * A2A task wire semantics (tasks/get, tasks/cancel, -32001/-32002 task
    error codes) — per the vendored A2A SDK as seen in kinocut (c7ce91e),
    Apache-2.0.

  * Agent-card shape — the production A2A agent-card reference (field shape
    only; every identity value on the served card is this bridge's own).

The agent card, all identity content, the cancel latch, the state map, the
opaque-taskId privacy boundary, and the protective limits (256 KB body,
24,000-char mission, 1-concurrent, 6/hour, 64-task table, submitted
deadline) are original to this add-on.
